    ],
    "negative_clarification": "Not credit-claiming when a senator discusses issues, criticizes others, or advocates for policies without explicitly attributing a successful outcome to their own actions. General statements of support, criticism, or calls to action do not qualify as credit-claiming unless the senator directly ties themselves to a specific, positive result.",
